cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "6,364 UV-Spectra Agroinfiltration Cell Death Area Images Scored by Severity"
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: dataset
version: 0.0.1
date-released: "2026-06-02"
license: CC-BY-NC-4.0
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.20493034
repository-code: https://github.com/joshuandwilliams/uv-agroinfiltration-dataset
keywords:
  - agroinfiltration
  - cell death
  - Nicotiana benthamiana
  - image dataset
  - severity scoring
  - UV spectra
  - plant immunity
  - inter-rater reliability
  - annotation
abstract: >
  A dataset of 6,364 annotated images of agroinfiltration cell death areas (CDAs)
  captured under UV-spectra light in Nicotiana benthamiana. The severity of cell
  death in each image has been scored on an ordinal scale from 0 (no cell death)
  to 6 (strong cell death) by 3 separate individuals, with the median score used
  as the ground truth label. Bounding box coordinates and individual scorer
  annotations are included to support inter-rater reliability research and
  re-extraction of crops at alternative resolutions.
